{"id": "L02-W1", "lane": "L02", "title": "The rule does not fix one law: no formation order, rate or unit", "plain": "The axioms say how likely each possibility is at a site once its neighbours are known. They do not say in what order sites get their records. The order matters: different orders give provably different overall laws, and the equilibrium law is none of them. Because the rule looks the same in every direction, no single fixed order can be chosen either. Something must say how records form: a rate, a unit, or a causal order.", "severity": "blocking", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_FORMATION_LAW_VERSUS_STATIC_LAW_FINITE_WINDOW_CLASSIFICATION_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-06.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_FORMATION_ORDER_MENU_ORDER_MIXTURE_MONOTONE_BOX_AND_CUBE_CENSUS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-13.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_HOW_RECORDS_FORM_STATIC_LAW_OUTSIDE_THE_HULL_OF_ADAPTED_FORMATION_LAWS_AND_CLAUSE_INDEPENDENCE_ON_A_CAUSAL_PREDECESSOR_STRUCTURE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-20.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_FORMATION_RATE_IDENTITIES_AND_FINITE_WINDOW_WITNESSES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-15.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_FORMATION_UNIT_CONDITIONAL_IDENTITIES_AND_FINITE_WITNESSES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-15.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_FINITE_UNRECORDED_COMPONENT_FACTORIZATION_AND_ATTACHMENT_FACTORS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-15.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-blocks-01-34-20260918:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD.md", "origin/ai/execution:TOE_SCORECARD.md", "/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes--claude-worktrees-toe-leverage-analysis-e8a790/af5789b9-888d-43b1-90de-58a07e0f2129/scratchpad/walls/L02_scratch/check_formation_vs_static.py", "/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes--claude-worktrees-toe-leverage-analysis-e8a790/af5789b9-888d-43b1-90de-58a07e0f2129/scratchpad/walls/L02_scratch/check_no_covariant_orientation.py", "archive/campaigns/opus-direct-20260827/POSITIVE_PATH.md"], "same_as": ["L01-W1", "L01-W2", "L15", "L04-W1"]}
{"id": "L02-W2", "lane": "L02", "title": "The axioms contain no dynamics; every dynamics used is a supplied clause", "plain": "The axioms give odds at a site but no motion: no quantum state, no rule for how unrecorded things change, no clock, no rule that keeps a record once written. Every \"dynamics\" in this lane is an added sentence, in three separate families, and none is adopted. Records that form only from their neighbours can never reproduce quantum (Bell) correlations (they stay at CHSH 2); a supplied quantum sentence reaches 2.83.", "severity": "blocking", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_CAMPAIGN_SYNTHESIS_WHAT_ONE_LOCAL_DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_BUYS_AND_WHAT_IT_LEAVES_OPEN_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_COVARIANT_NEAREST_NEIGHBOUR_TWO_QUBIT_GENERATORS_HEISENBERG_UNDER_POSSIBILITY_COVARIANCE_THREE_COUPLINGS_UNDER_FULL_SOLDERING_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_RECORDS_ONLY_ADMISSIBILITY_LEAVES_THE_DYNAMICS_UNREADABLE_FORMING_SITES_MUST_BE_ISOLATED_AND_NEVER_INTERACT_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_BELL_VALUES_OF_RECORD_LAWS_RECORDS_ONLY_FORMATION_STAYS_AT_TWO_THE_DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_REACHES_TWO_ROOT_TWO_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_LOCALITY_OF_MARGINALS_MAKES_A_SITE_S_EVOLUTION_BETWEEN_RECORDS_LINEAR_AND_COMPLETELY_POSITIVE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/FINITE_ACTION_FUNCTIONAL_TYPED_ADMISSIBILITY_RECORD_IDENTIFICATION_DECISION_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-02.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_AXIOM_MINIMAL_NONTRIVIALITY_BRANCH_PROPOSAL_2026-06-29.md", "archive/campaigns/opus-direct-20260827/POSITIVE_PATH.md"], "same_as": ["L03-W10", "L03-W4", "L01-W7", "L04-W1", "L02-W3"]}
{"id": "L02-W3", "lane": "L02", "title": "The wording of the dynamics depends on what a \"record\" is, and the simplest reading fails", "plain": "Which dynamics sentence is right depends on what a record is: a sharp one-site lock, a soft large-scale lock, a marker riding a quantum wave, or something that emerges. Tests so far kill the simplest picture: a sharp lock costs the energy of its bonds, and under a unitary wave a record count that never falls also never rises. No reading is derived from the axioms.", "severity": "blocking", "status": "possibly misframed", "evidence": ["origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/RECORD_FORMATION_A_SHARP_ONE_SITE_LOCK_COSTS_THE_ENERGY_OF_ITS_BONDS_IN_THE_WALKERS_SEA_ABOUT_TWO_POINT_FOUR_LATTICE_ENERGY_UNITS_PER_RECORD_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-27.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/UNDER_A_UNITARY_WAVE_WITH_BORN_COUNT_STATISTICS_A_RECORD_COUNT_THAT_NEVER_FALLS_NEVER_RISES_RECORDS_CANNOT_FORM_FROM_NOTHING_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-28.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/RECORDS_AS_BEABLES_UNDER_THE_MOVING_RECORDS_READING_BELLS_JUMP_LAW_GIVES_NEAREST_NEIGHBOUR_MOVES_EQUIVARIANT_ODDS_AND_BELL_CORRELATIONS_WITH_NONLOCAL_ODDS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-27.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md", "/Users/jonBridger/.claude/projects/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes/memory/records-move-owner-reading.md", "/Users/jonBridger/.claude/projects/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes/memory/records-count-rises-until-frozen.md"], "same_as": ["L01-W3", "L01-W4", "L01-W10", "L03-W5", "L03-W6", "L15", "L02-W2"]}
{"id": "L02-W4", "lane": "L02", "title": "No selection principle for the action, the Hamiltonian or the couplings", "plain": "Nothing in the axioms says which energy function or action governs the lattice, or even that it is nonzero. \"No motion at all\" fits every constraint proved so far, and the standard candidate actions (Wilson, heat-kernel, Manton) give measurably different answers at lattice scale. Every attempt to pick one has ended with the selection listed as still open. All couplings, stiffnesses and units are inputs.", "severity": "blocking", "status": "open", "evidence": ["docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_NONTRIVIALITY_SELECTION_FIREWALL_2026-06-06.md", "docs/BRIDGE_GAP_ACTION_FORM_UNIQUENESS_NO_GO_NOTE_2026-05-06.md", "docs/ACTION_FORM_NO_GO_EQUIVALENCE_PREMISE_CONTINUUM_REMOVAL_SCOPED_RELOCATION_NOTE_2026-06-08.md", "archive/chains/july-kernel-rule-era.md", "archive/notes/docs/RECORD_COMPOSITION_BRIDGE_SEMIGROUP_POSITIVITY_SELECTION_BOUNDED_NOTE_2026-07-02.md", "docs/repo/DEFERRED_DECISIONS.md", "origin/ai/execution:TOE_SCORECARD.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_FORM_FROM_RECORD_PRESERVATION_GAUGE_INVARIANT_LOCAL_CLASS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-06-05.md"], "same_as": ["L06-W4", "L06-W1", "L01-W14", "L14", "L16", "L05", "L11"]}
{"id": "L02-W5", "lane": "L02", "title": "Even given an action, the axioms' odds are not identified with it (the typed interface)", "plain": "Suppose an action is chosen. The axioms' \"odds\" are still not automatically what the action calculates. An action gives a state; a state gives probabilities only after you say which question is asked; and the answer must be matched to what the record locks. Small exact examples show each link can fail separately. Owner options for wording this exist; none is adopted.", "severity": "major", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/FINITE_ACTION_FUNCTIONAL_TYPED_ADMISSIBILITY_RECORD_IDENTIFICATION_DECISION_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-02.md", "docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "/Users/jonBridger/.claude/projects/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes/memory/axiom-update-criterion.md", "/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes--claude-worktrees-toe-leverage-analysis-e8a790/af5789b9-888d-43b1-90de-58a07e0f2129/scratchpad/walls/L02_scratch/check_identity10.py"], "same_as": ["L03-W2", "L03-W3", "L02-W6"]}
{"id": "L02-W6", "lane": "L02", "title": "The statistical bridge (Born-type weights) cannot be derived and is parked unadopted", "plain": "Why should formation odds equal the weights the mathematics suggests (Born-type)? Every derivation door tried is closed at its stated scope: pure additivity cannot force it, no covariant dynamics can pick it, and the last live construction failed its own pre-set test. What is left is adopting it as a postulate. The text exists but is parked; the owner's rule is: identify the action first.", "severity": "blocking", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/repo/DEFERRED_DECISIONS.md", "archive/campaigns/exercise-bridge-adoption-20260826/SYNTHESIS.md", "archive/campaigns/exercise-bridge-adoption-20260826/SIGNING_TEXT_FINAL.md", "archive/campaigns/generator-program-20260821/SYNTHESIS.md", "docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "docs/repo/STATE_OF_THE_THEORY_2026-07-16.md", "origin/ai/execution:TOE_SCORECARD.md"], "same_as": ["L03-W1", "L03-W9", "L01-W14", "L02-W5"]}
{"id": "L02-W7", "lane": "L02", "title": "The source-to-action and log-det readout bridge lost its footing when Record additivity was removed", "plain": "The older route from the lattice to an action ran through \"the total of a group of records is the sum of the parts\". That sentence was removed from the axioms on 2026-08-13, so the log-determinant generating function and what was built on it lost its support. The link from an action to physical sources and readings (charge, mass, gravity) was named open in eight places and remains so.", "severity": "major", "status": "open", "evidence": ["docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "docs/OBSERVABLE_PRINCIPLE_FROM_AXIOM_NOTE.md", "docs/OBSERVABLE_PRINCIPLE_T1D_DETERMINANT_READOUT_INDEPENDENCE_NO_GO_NOTE_2026-06-16.md", "docs/SOURCE_ACTION_BRIDGE_PRICING_CYCLE871_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-07-28.md", "archive/chains/july-kernel-rule-era.md", "origin/ai/execution:TOE_SCORECARD.md"], "same_as": ["L14", "L03", "L11", "L16"]}
{"id": "L02-W8", "lane": "L02", "title": "The literal formation law does not propagate; the readings that do add a clause", "plain": "Read literally, each site gets one record once, with odds that cannot be negative. In the tested versions the laws this produces have the wrong character: irreversible, diffusive, effectively two-dimensional, no travelling waves and no three-dimensional potential. The readings that give waves or long-range order need a sentence the axioms exclude (records re-forming every tick), contradict (records that move), or lack (dynamics for the unrecorded amplitude).", "severity": "major", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_WAVES_NEED_SIGNED_WEIGHTS_A_FORMATION_RULE_WITH_NONNEGATIVE_WEIGHTS_KEEPS_AN_UNDAMPED_BRANCH_ONLY_BY_RIGID_TRANSPORT_AND_THE_AMPLITUDE_STEP_IS_A_SIGNED_RULE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_WAVES_AMONG_MOVING_RECORDS_NEED_A_COUPLING_THAT_TIME_REVERSAL_FLIPS_CLOCKED_RECORD_MOTION_NEVER_OSCILLATES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-23.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_GRAVITY_NODE_KERNEL_UNDER_THE_FORMATION_READING_A_HEAT_KERNEL_IN_LEVEL_TIME_TIMES_A_PLANE_GREEN_FUNCTION_NOT_THE_COMPARATORS_THREE_DIMENSIONAL_GREEN_FUNCTION_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-18.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_THREE_READINGS_OF_RECORDS_FORM_AGAINST_KNOWN_PHYSICS_THE_SPACETIME_READING_IS_TWO_DIMENSIONAL_SKEWED_AND_IRREVERSIBLE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-23.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_RE_RECORDING_AT_EVERY_TICK_STATIC_LAW_STATIONARY_LIGHT_CONE_BILAYER_LONG_RANGE_ORDER_GREEN_FUNCTION_RESPONSE_CONDITIONAL_ON_AN_EXCLUDED_CLAUSE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-20.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_LIGHT_CONE_FORMATION_KEEPS_MEMORY_IN_3PLUS1_ITS_STATIONARY_LAW_IS_ONE_LAYER_OF_A_REFLECTION_POSITIVE_BILAYER_ORDERED_ABOVE_BETA_0P5905_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-23.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_COVARIANCE_FORCES_A_REVERSIBLE_FORMATION_LAW_THREE_COVARIANT_PASTS_AND_THE_SIX_NEIGHBOUR_PAST_SETTLES_INTO_TWO_COPIES_OF_THE_STATIC_LAW_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-23.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-blocks-01-34-20260918:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD.md", "/Users/jonBridger/.claude/projects/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes/memory/admissibility-induced-law-block94.md"], "same_as": ["L01-W8", "L04-W2", "L14"]}
{"id": "L02-W9", "lane": "L02", "title": "Time: no master clock means no propagating field; discrete ticks are exact only for still walkers", "plain": "If no place has a master clock, a field of clock rates cannot carry a wave: the equations tie each place only to its neighbours and give no travelling mode. Adding a master clock fixes that but gives a speed set by the local rate and no sharp light cone. The lane's gravity-like law is therefore instantaneous (it acts at a distance). With discrete ticks a local clock rule stays exact only for walkers that do not move.", "severity": "major", "status": "open", "evidence": ["docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_A_DELAY_FOR_THE_RATE_FIELD_NEIGHBOUR_REFERRED_MOTION_DOES_NOT_PROPAGATE_A_REFERENCE_TO_DISTANT_CLOCKS_DOES_AT_A_SPEED_SET_BY_THE_LOCAL_RATE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-21.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_NO_MASTER_CLOCK_A_NEIGHBOUR_DETERMINED_SCALE_COVARIANT_TICK_RATE_OBEYS_THE_LATTICE_LAPLACE_EQUATION_RECORDS_ENTER_AS_ADDITIVE_SOURCES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-21.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_IN_DISCRETE_TICKS_A_LOCAL_CLOCK_IS_EXACT_ONLY_FOR_WALKS_THAT_DO_NOT_MOVE_THE_FLAT_BAND_THEOREM_AND_A_WALK_CLOCKED_TO_RELATIVE_EPS_SQUARED_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-23.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md", "docs/KINETIC_ISOTROPY_PRIMITIVE_NOTE_2026-06-09.md", "docs/MINIMAL_AXIOMS_2026-06-29.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_AXIOM_MINIMAL_NONTRIVIALITY_BRANCH_PROPOSAL_2026-06-29.md"], "same_as": ["L04-W1", "L04-W3", "L04-W9", "L14"]}
{"id": "L02-W10", "lane": "L02", "title": "Forces as balance-law patterns: the lane's covariant clause cannot move them, and Admissibility is not shown to be such a law", "plain": "Forces such as light are naturally patterns that obey a balance rule at every site. But any rule built only from neighbouring pairs, including the Heisenberg bond (the only pair rule that treats all qubit directions alike), leaves such a pattern frozen. Moving it needs four-link loops or three-site hops that the axioms do not supply. One qubit also cannot carry a covariant charge or a non-abelian link. So \"Admissibility as a balance law\" is a hope, not a derivation.", "severity": "major", "status": "open", "evidence": ["docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_AN_EXACT_GAUSS_LAW_FREEZES_THE_LINK_FIELD_UNDER_EVERY_TWO_SITE_GENERATOR_THE_FIELD_MOVES_BY_RINGS_AND_HOPS_INSIDE_ONE_NEIGHBOURHOOD_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_THE_LANDED_TENSOR_CONSTRAINTS_FREEZE_UNDER_TWO_SITE_GENERATORS_AND_NO_SINGLE_NEIGHBOURHOOD_MOVES_THEM_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_CHARGES_ARE_GAUSS_DEFECTS_NO_QUBIT_CARRIES_A_COVARIANT_CHARGE_UNDER_FULL_SOLDERING_DEFECTS_ARE_BOSONS_AND_RECORD_PHASES_ARE_PURE_GAUGE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_NON_ABELIAN_GAUGE_LINKS_NEED_SEVERAL_QUBITS_ONE_QUBIT_CARRIES_NO_SU_N_LINK_SU2_NEEDS_TWO_SU3_THREE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_COVARIANT_NEAREST_NEIGHBOUR_TWO_QUBIT_GENERATORS_HEISENBERG_UNDER_POSSIBILITY_COVARIANCE_THREE_COUPLINGS_UNDER_FULL_SOLDERING_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/DYNAMICS_CLAUSE_THE_COVARIANT_PLAQUETTE_CLAUSE_ANNIHILATES_UNIFORM_ICE_EXACTLY_AT_THE_ROKHSAR_KIVELSON_POINT_AND_UNRECORDED_PLAQUETTES_CAN_POLARIZE_THE_ICE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md"], "same_as": ["L06-W9", "L06-W10", "L06-W12", "L06-W3", "L01-W12", "L14"]}
{"id": "L02-W11", "lane": "L02", "title": "One record per site is an interaction that breaks the energy and momentum books; three things cannot all hold", "plain": "Matter is supposed to source gravity through exact bookkeeping (energy and momentum in equal out). That works for free particles. When particles obey \"one record per site\" they lose the bookkeeping at leading orders and nothing local restores it; the price of forming a record is not local either. Three things cannot all hold: the chosen gravity field, one-per-site records, and exact equations.", "severity": "major", "status": "possibly misframed", "evidence": ["docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_ONE_RECORD_PER_SITE_KEEPS_THE_BOOKS_ONLY_AT_LEADING_ORDER_TWO_EXCLUDED_RECORDS_LOSE_THEIR_ENERGY_CURRENT_IN_TWO_AND_THREE_DIMENSIONS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-25.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_EXACT_BOOKS_NEED_RECORDS_THAT_NEVER_SCATTER_OR_BIND_NOTHING_LOCAL_KEEPS_THEM_UNDER_ONE_RECORD_PER_SITE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-25.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_NO_FINITE_RANGE_INTERACTION_KEEPS_TWO_EXCLUDED_RECORDS_TOTAL_ENERGY_CURRENT_ON_THE_PLANE_OR_IN_SPACE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-26.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_UNDER_ONE_RECORD_PER_SITE_A_COLLISION_CHANGES_THE_RECORDS_TWO_STEP_MOMENTUM_ONLY_AT_THIRD_ORDER_IN_THEIR_OFFSETS_FROM_THE_CONES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-26.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md"], "same_as": ["L01-W9", "L14"]}
{"id": "L02-W12", "lane": "L02", "title": "No rest energy (mass) is induced; it is supplied", "plain": "The lane's basic moving particle has no rest mass: the qubit space has no room for a term that would give it one (checked). Mass needs an added staggered term, or binding of two particles; binding works in one dimension but is killed by \"one record per site\" and is lopsided in three. Rest mass is supplied, not derived.", "severity": "major", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_THE_BOOKS_ADMIT_ONE_REST_ENERGY_THE_STAGGERED_MASS_KEEPS_THEM_EXACTLY_SO_MASSIVE_CONTENT_MEETS_THE_MEMBER_IFF_ALPHA_EQUALS_K_OVER_FOUR_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-25.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_A_REST_ENERGY_FROM_BINDING_TWO_WALKERS_IS_EXACT_WITH_THE_WALKERS_OWN_SPEED_IN_ONE_DIMENSION_INVISIBLE_UNDER_ONE_RECORD_PER_SITE_AND_ANISOTROPIC_IN_THREE_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_THE_AXIOMS_OWN_GENERATOR_THE_SCALAR_HOP_SPLITS_THE_EIGHT_SPECIES_INTO_FOUR_LEVELS_OF_ONE_SENSE_AND_A_STAGGERED_TERM_GIVES_THEM_MASS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-22.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_A_CHESSBOARD_RECORD_BACKGROUND_IS_FELT_ONLY_AS_A_REST_MASS_AND_A_WALL_BETWEEN_OUT_OF_STEP_DOMAINS_BINDS_EXACT_ZERO_MODES_WHEN_ODD_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-22.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md", "docs/repo/DEFERRED_DECISIONS.md", "origin/claude/toe-viability-probes-20260927:docs/TOE_VIABILITY_MAP_WHERE_THE_AXIOMS_ARE_EXPOSED_AND_THE_FASTEST_DECISIVE_TESTS_2026-09-27.md", "/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes--claude-worktrees-toe-leverage-analysis-e8a790/af5789b9-888d-43b1-90de-58a07e0f2129/scratchpad/walls/L02_scratch/check_no_rest_mass.py"], "same_as": ["L05-W6", "L07", "L09", "L16"]}
{"id": "L02-W13", "lane": "L02", "title": "The exchange sign (statistics) is not supplied by records", "plain": "Do swapped identical records pick up a minus sign (fermions) or not? Both choices satisfy every axiom exactly. They first differ in a fourth-order energy moment, and for the reduced walk their spectra coincide on odd rings. So matter statistics must be supplied from outside.", "severity": "minor", "status": "priced", "evidence": ["docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_THE_EXCHANGE_SIGN_IS_NOT_SUPPLIED_BY_RECORDS_BOTH_HARD_CORE_SECTORS_MEET_EVERY_AXIOM_AND_FIRST_DIFFER_IN_THE_FOURTH_MOMENT_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-24.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_ONE_RECORD_PER_SITE_IS_AN_INTERACTION_NOT_A_FREE_SEA_TWO_RECORDS_UNDER_EXCLUSION_AGAINST_FREE_ANTISYMMETRIC_AND_SYMMETRIC_PAIRS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-22.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-source-link-amplitude-layer-20260921:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD_source_link_amplitude_layer_20260921.md"], "same_as": ["L05-W1", "L01-W9"]}
{"id": "L02-W14", "lane": "L02", "title": "Ordered-phase thresholds are proved far from where they are observed", "plain": "Does the formation law keep a memory of direction (an ordered phase)? Numerically yes above a modest coupling (about 11). The landed theorem proves it only from about 285,000; the campaign's record quotes 4165, and a refereed, unlanded probe gets 84. The natural proof route was refuted, and the campaign advises stopping. For the sphere version no ordered phase was found.", "severity": "minor", "status": "open", "evidence": ["docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_SIX_AXIS_FORMATION_THRESHOLD_THE_UNIT_BUDGET_IS_FALSE_ONE_SEED_WITNESS_WITH_FAMILY_CONSTANT_TEN_NINTHS_TIGHT_SIBLING_LEMMA_REFUTED_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-20.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_THREE_DIMENSIONAL_FORMATION_LAW_ORDERED_PHASE_STABILITY_OF_THE_NOISY_LEVEL_AUTOMATON_EXPLICIT_THRESHOLD_SIX_INVARIANT_LAWS_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-16.md", "docs/SIX_AXIS_TWO_LEVEL_DOMINATION_EXTENDED_EXPLANATION_TREE_AND_FOUR_RATIONAL_CERTIFICATES_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-16.md", "docs/ADMISSIBILITY_RULE_STRONG_COUPLING_FORMATION_LAW_LEVEL_AUTOMATON_ERODER_METASTABILITY_ORDERED_PHASE_OBLIGATION_BOUNDED_THEOREM_NOTE_2026-09-15.md", "/Users/jonBridger/.claude/projects/-Users-jonBridger-Projects-Physics-baremetal-probes/memory/probe-harvest-20260919.md", "origin/physics-loop/admissibility-induced-law-decision-record-blocks-01-34-20260918:.claude/science/physics-loops/admissibility-induced-law-20260906/DECISION_RECORD.md"], "same_as": ["L01"]}
